  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIGIFEMMES - G NET+ Business Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To make our activities better known, we have decided to create a website and a WhatsApp business platform:.-A dedicated and personalized space to communicate about our services .-Improve our visibility and find new customers .-Provide quotes .-The possibility of receiving payments directly online .-A platform available 7 days a week, 24 hours a day for our prospects..It will enable us to develop our customers&apos; trust and our after-sales service capacity. .Inventory management, manage reservations and appointments in your diary. Digital tools will help us make better decisions and increase our profits. Thanks to this site, we&apos;ll have advance information for good customer follow-up, we&apos;ll be able to make money by consulting the weather and grouping our services by geographical area. The website will enable us to Increase our sales by over 60%.</narrative>
  </description>
